{%- comment -%}
===============================================================================
  MyFrequentRewards — lifecycle email system v6
  -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Template   : 03. Forgot password
  File       : forgot-password.liquid
  Class      : Auth (transactional — no unsubscribe)
  Trigger    : Password reset requested from the login page
  Tone       : security
  Replaces   : forgot-password.liquid

  SUBJECT LINES — pick one, or A/B them
    1. Reset your MyFrequentRewards password

  PREHEADER
    The link works for 24 hours. If you did not request it, nothing has changed.

  PRIMARY CTA
    Reset my password  ->  forgot-password?user=…&code=…

  PLAIN-TEXT ALTERNATIVE
    dist/text/forgot-password.txt — send as the text/plain part of a multipart message.
    HTML-only mail is scored down by most spam filters.

  Generated from react/src/emails/03-forgot-password.jsx — edit the JSX and re-run
  `npm run build`. Hand edits to this file are overwritten.

  Images are served from the base configured at build time; upload assets/
  there before sending. Serve over HTTPS from a stable path — clients do not
  retry a 404, so a moved asset breaks every copy already delivered.
===============================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}
